<title>POLAND: RELPOL FEB NET RISES TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>RELPOL FEB NET RISES TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.09 vs   0.44</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.76 vs   0.66</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.38 vs   0.56</p>
<p> Sales		   10.41 vs   3.36</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.13 vs   0.99</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.35 vs   1.42</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.67 vs   1.42</p>
<p> Sales		   14.22 vs   6.97</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish electromagnetic trasmitter maker</p>
<p>is Relpol SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
